    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/cat-quest/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "Cat Quest is an open world RPG set in the pawsome world of cats! In search of your catnapped sister you pounce into the massive continent of Felingard -- a world crafted in the style of overworld maps of yore and purrrring with cat-tastic characters, stories, and puns!\n\nLeap into a grand adventure in purrsuit of the evil Drakoth and your catnapped sister! Explore Felingard's huge overworld map, risk life and limb delving into dungeons for epic loot, and lend a paw to a furry cast of characters in a flurry of side quests.",
