  "1561340": {
    "id": "mc-berserk-boy",
    "source": "metacritic",
    "score": 83,
    "tier": "Strong",
    "numReviews": 16,
    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/berserk-boy/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "In the distant future... Driven insane by his obsession with Berserk Force Orbs, the diabolical Dr. Genos and his army of Dark Energy minions wage war on the people of Earth. Hope for all humanity rests with The Resistance, but are they enough? As the battle begins, a new hero joins the fight...\n\nBerserk Boy is a vibrant, retro-inspired 2D action platformer that lets you... GO BERSERK! Change into different forms and use the power of Lightning, Fire, Earth, Air, and Ice as you race through stylish stages in a heroic battle to save the planet from the evil Dr. Genos!",
    "isVerified": true,
    "isSynthetic": false
  },
  "1562430": {
    "id": "mc-dredge",
    "source": "metacritic",
    "score": 80,
    "tier": "Strong",
    "numReviews": 43,
    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/dredge/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "Dredge is a fishing adventure with a sinister undercurrent. Sell your catch, upgrade your vessel and dredge the depths for long-buried relics. Explore the stories of the strange locals and discover why some things are best left forgotten. \r\n\r\nStarting from your new home in a group of islands known as The Marrows, upgrade your engines and set sail for the neighboring regions - each with their own unique fish, personalities and secrets.\r\nDredge up forgotten treasures. Outsmart unremembered terrors.\r\n\r\nSomeone wants very badly to retrieve relics lost to the ocean floor. The work is lucrative, but can you trust them? What will they use the relics for? And will they ever be satisfied?\r\n\r\nIt's not just the sharp rocks and shallow reefs you need to watch out for - keep your eyes on the depths below and the sky above. The biggest threat to your safety might come from within.",
    "isVerified": true,
    "isSynthetic": false
  },
  "1574580": {
    "id": "mc-strange-horticulture",
    "source": "metacritic",
    "score": 83,
    "tier": "Strong",
    "numReviews": 13,
    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/strange-horticulture/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "Welcome to Undermere, a quaint town surrounded by hag-infested forests and rugged mountains. You are the Horticulturist, owner of local plant store Strange Horticulture. As a cast of colorful customers come by your shop, you are quickly thrust into an occult mystery stretching back hundreds of years.\n\nStrange Horticulture is an occult puzzle game in which you play as the proprietor of a local plant store. Find and identify new plants, pet your cat, speak to a coven, or join a cult. Use your collection of powerful plants to influence the story and unravel Undermere's dark mysteries.",
    "isVerified": true,
    "isSynthetic": false
  },
  "1578650": {
    "id": "mc-citizen-sleeper",
    "source": "metacritic",
    "score": 82,
    "tier": "Strong",
    "numReviews": 23,
    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/citizen-sleeper/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "Live the life of an escaped worker, washed-up on a lawless station at the edge of an interstellar society. Inspired by the flexibility and freedom of Tabletop RPGs, explore the station, choose your friends, escape your past and change your future.\r\nLIFE ON ERLIN'S EYE\r\nAn abandoned station on the edge of a system in crisis. Run down, chaotic, unruly, and alive—it was founded by idealists in the shadow of a corporate collapse. Now it is held together by anarchic alliances, ramshackle factions and a shared desire to be free from the gravity of corporate control.\r\n\r\nDO THE WORK. GET PAID. SURVIVE.\r\nEvery cycle you get up and choose what to do with your time. Toil in the yards, or take a bar shift. Search the markets for rare components or grab some street food. Make or break alliances, uncover truths and escape those that hunt you. Learn to survive and ultimately thrive, one cycle at a time.\r\n\r\nTURN UP FOR YOUR FRIENDS\r\nThe station plays host to characters from all walks of life, trying to eke out an existence among the stars. Salvagers, engineers, hackers, bartenders, street-food vendors, each has a history which brought them here. You choose which of them you wish to help, and together you will shape your future.\r\n\r\nACCESS THEIR SECRETS\r\nHack into the station’s cloud to access decades of digital data, uncover new areas and unlock secrets. This is your unique power, and with it you can change your future. Corporate secrets, rogue AIs and troves of lost data await those willing to dive into the depths of the station’s networks.\r\n\r\nYOU WERE MADE TO DIE\r\nEssen-Arp: to them you are just property, one more asset in a portfolio that stretches across the stars. You are the product of an abusive system, in a universe where humanity’s expansion is marked by exploitation and extraction. Escape the makers of your decaying body, and chart your own path in a richly imagined, deeply relevant sci-fi world which explores ideas of precarity, personhood and freedom.",
    "isVerified": true,
    "isSynthetic": false
  },
