    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/rogue-waters/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "Rogue Waters is a tactical, turn-based rogue-lite set in a pirate world overtaken by a terrible curse. \r\n\r\nGather your ragtag crew of rogues and grow them into fierce pirates. Befriend and call upon legendary creatures of sailors' myths. Chart your course through an ever-changing game world, and turn the tides of battle on land or sea in a fresh take on tactical turn-based combat. \r\n\r\nThe crew and the Kraken await your command - will ye heed the call?",
