  "1939970": {
    "id": "mc-nobody-wants-to-die",
    "source": "metacritic",
    "score": 75,
    "tier": "Strong",
    "numReviews": 22,
    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/nobody-wants-to-die/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "Lose yourself in the world of New York, 2329, where immortality comes at a price that someone has to pay. \r\n\r\nFollowing a near-death experience, Detective James Karra takes an off-the-books case from his chief with only the help of a young police liaison, Sara Kai, to assist him. Time reveals all as they risk everything in pursuit of a killer, uncovering the dark secrets of the city's elite.\r\n\r\nSee through the eyes of Mortality Department Detective James Karra on his hunt for a serial killer who targets the city's elite citizens. Investigate crime scenes using his time manipulation augmentation and advanced technology to reconstruct events leading up to each murder and uncover clues that lead to the horrifying truth behind the murders.\r\n\r\nLose yourself in a dystopian future through this meaningful and original interactive detective story, that explores the dangers of transhumanism and immortality.",
    "isVerified": true,
    "isSynthetic": false
  },
  "1944430": {
    "id": "mc-amnesia-the-bunker",
    "source": "metacritic",
    "score": 77,
    "tier": "Strong",
    "numReviews": 63,
    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/amnesia-the-bunker/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "Left all alone in a desolate WW1 bunker with only one bullet remaining in the barrel, it's up to you to face the oppressing terrors in the dark. Keep the lights on at all costs, persevere, and make your way out alive. In the shoes of the French soldier Henri Clément, you are armed with a revolver gun, a noisy dynamo flashlight, and other scarce supplies to scavenge and craft along the way. With randomization and unpredictable behavior, no play-through is the same.\r\n\r\nHunted by an ever-present threat reacting to your every move and sound, you must adapt your play-style to face hell. Every decision will change the outcome of how the game responds.",
    "isVerified": true,
    "isSynthetic": false
  },
  "1959390": {
    "id": "mc-fear-the-spotlight",
    "source": "metacritic",
    "score": 83,
    "tier": "Strong",
    "numReviews": 18,
    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/fear-the-spotlight/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "You and your friend Amy sneak into school after hours to perform a séance. Things go horribly wrong and you become lost and separated.\n\nIn search of Amy, you explore a section of the school that was condemned long ago because of a tragic fire. It's up to you to explore the decrepit halls, unravel the mysterious past, and save your friend Amy.\n\nFear the Spotlight is a third-person survival horror adventure with a PS1 inspired visual style. After a séance goes wrong, you have to solve puzzles, hide from monsters, and search an empty school for your missing friend.",
    "isVerified": true,
    "isSynthetic": false
  },
