    "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/game/guardians-of-the-galaxy/critic-reviews/",
    "summary": "A brand new story of the universe’s unlikeliest heroes: Star-Lord, Gamora, Drax, Rocket, and Groot. Marvel’s Guardians of the Galaxy: The Telltale Series is a five-part episodic series. Players take on multiple roles within the ragtag band of heroes, and take the pilot's seat in directing their escapades around the universe.",
