    "summary": "Trine Enchanted Edition is a fantasy-based action platformer with a fairytale-esque atmosphere, which tracks the journey of three heroes – a Wizard, a Knight and a Thief – in a mission to save the kingdom from evil. The action is founded in fully interactive physics – each character’s unique abilities and tactics can be utilized to invent new ways to battle an army of undead and defeat obstacles, and restore the order of the world.",
